    - type: 1
      text: "Identification pr\xE9coce d\u2019incidents (incendie, d\xE9g\xE2ts mat\xE9riels...)
        avant qu\u2019ils ne s\u2019aggravent "
    - type: 1
      text: "Identification d\u2019\xE9ventuelles pr\xE9sences non autoris\xE9es
        \r\n"
